# Vervato (PrimevalSummoner): Payer's party member Fallen lies dead on the isle, the territory of
# Vervato's npcmaker, 240 from Vervato: outside the drift range a maker-less NPC's territory
# would be. Paying the fee answers no page: the adena go and Vervato casts Corpse Revival on
# himself (onTalk). Asking again while the summon is under way takes the fee again and answers
# vervato005.htm. As the cast ends Fallen's body is brought to Vervato's side, off the isle
# (onUseSkillFinished), and three seconds later Payer is shown vervato004.htm and Vervato is free
# again (onTimer): with the body off the isle there is none left to summon, vervato002.htm, and
# nothing is paid.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (PrimevalSummoner.java); the reference
# probe has no party member nor npcmaker territory to play this with.
character Payer 20
member Fallen 20 dead 300 0 0
hold 57 400000
script script.teleport.PrimevalSummoner
item 57
page default/32104.htm
page script/teleport/PrimevalSummoner/
territory isle -100 -100 400 400 -100 100
npc vervato 32104 Folk 60 0 0 maker isle

action vervato
action vervato
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=vervato item=0 page=default/32104.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{vervato}_Quest PrimevalSummoner
  S SystemMessage id=672 1:200000
  S ActionFailed
  items 57=200000
tick x3
  S MagicSkillUse caster=vervato target=vervato skill=5121-1 hit=1321 reuse=0 success=0
bypass npc_{vervato}_Quest PrimevalSummoner
  S SystemMessage id=672 1:200000
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=vervato item=0 page=script/teleport/PrimevalSummoner/vervato005.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  items 57=0
advance 1600ms
advance 3s
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=vervato item=0 page=script/teleport/PrimevalSummoner/vervato004.htm
  S ActionFailed
action vervato
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=vervato item=0 page=default/32104.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{vervato}_Quest PrimevalSummoner
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=vervato item=0 page=script/teleport/PrimevalSummoner/vervato002.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  items 57=0
